  "releaseNotes": "Adds opt-in ForwardedHeaders:TrustAllProxies for private gateways behind controlled ingress without enumerating proxy IPs or subnets. The package processes one forwarded hop before routing and rate limiting while preserving forwarded-host, BFF origin, CSRF and authentication checks. Strict proxy trust remains the default.",
